                              "content": "MEMORANDUM OF LEGAL RESEARCH\n\nTo: Instructing Solicitor / End User\nFrom: Senior Research Counsel — Australian Immigration\nSubject: Application of s 5J(3) Migration Act 1958 (Cth) to credibility assessments involving past torture allegations and inconsistent dates.\n\nDisclaimer: Research-oriented analysis grounded in current Australian migration authorities. Not legal advice; review by a registered migration agent or admitted lawyer is required before relying on any conclusion in submissions or hearings.\n\nScope: §1 Statutory framework. §2 Leading authorities. §3 Evidentiary practice in the Tribunal.",
