    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "E7o1WL",
      "x": 12409,
      "y": 2240,
      "name": "motionNote",
      "width": 540,
      "height": 240,
      "content": "FOCUS MODE TRANSITIONS\n\n• Sidebar fold: width 240 → 64px (180ms ease-out)\n• Right column fade-out: opacity 1 → 0, scale 1 → 0.96 (140ms ease-in)\n• Council panel: width grows to fill freed space (180ms ease-out, sync with sidebar)\n• Hero card: collapses from 2-col to compact banner (200ms ease-out)\n\nTriggers:\n→ Enter focus: deliberation starts (Cmd+Enter pressed)\n→ Exit focus: verdict ready OR Stop deliberation clicked"
    },
